WEBVTT

00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:15,290
Question it. I have a lump on my lower leg doctor said he didn't think it was anything

00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:21,970
Had two ultrasounds have a CT scan tomorrow doctor said he may have it removed

00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:26,370
Worried about that iodide dye is that dangerous?

00:00:29,410 --> 00:00:31,410
Okay, so

00:00:31,850 --> 00:00:36,130
A lot of lumps, you know, it's really hard to answer this without actually see it and

00:00:36,770 --> 00:00:38,530
looking at that

00:00:38,610 --> 00:00:40,610
But a lot of lumps are

00:00:42,490 --> 00:00:47,850
Superficial lumps on your surface on your skin, you know, most common thing would be a lipoma

00:00:49,130 --> 00:00:55,130
But almost any doctor that has any experience can basically palpate that lump and tell

00:00:56,410 --> 00:01:05,170
With with a fair degree of certainty whether it's a lipomo or not because it'll typically be movable, you know, feel like it's encapsulated and

00:01:05,570 --> 00:01:07,570
And

00:01:07,570 --> 00:01:13,730
But there's nothing wrong with getting some imaging done. So I think that's the right thing to do is to get some imaging done

00:01:14,170 --> 00:01:17,170
I'm not sure what you're talking about with the iodide dye

00:01:19,170 --> 00:01:23,730
A CT scan is going to have radiation in a CT scan with contrast

00:01:25,610 --> 00:01:32,290
Is you know, you know, you're getting semi invasive there, but still you want to rule that out. You want to make sure

00:01:32,770 --> 00:01:35,570
There isn't anything anything more serious

00:01:37,090 --> 00:01:41,250
Most surface lumps on adults are going to be bedoied

00:01:42,730 --> 00:01:50,610
If it's a child in a lump on their leg, that's very scary. You got different sarcomas. You have different

00:01:53,330 --> 00:01:56,890
cancers that can be very serious as a younger person

00:01:57,290 --> 00:02:03,530
But typically on an older person is it's in your thigh or something and you get a lump. It's

00:02:04,570 --> 00:02:06,570
most commonly a podine

00:02:07,050 --> 00:02:08,250
tumor

00:02:08,250 --> 00:02:10,730
lipoma is one of the more common ones

00:02:12,250 --> 00:02:15,770
And lipomas can be surgically excised very easily

00:02:17,050 --> 00:02:19,050
If you don't have multiple lipomas

00:02:20,010 --> 00:02:22,010
Typically they don't come back. I mean

00:02:22,810 --> 00:02:28,410
People people can get people can have you know different lipomas come back

00:02:29,210 --> 00:02:34,010
But it's not that that lipoba is spreadied or anything like a metastatic tumor or anything like that

00:02:34,890 --> 00:02:36,890
so

00:02:36,890 --> 00:02:41,450
It's good that you're getting it checked out. I wouldn't be overly nervous about it. It's but

00:02:43,450 --> 00:02:48,090
It's definitely good to get checked out and getting lipoba removed typically

00:02:48,650 --> 00:02:50,650
involves no danger whatsoever

00:02:52,010 --> 00:02:54,650
It's very common occurrence

